The Elephant Graveyard of Wonders lies in the desert of the Serengeti, in the film made by the [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/Arcane Intelligence|arcane intelligence]]. Elephants come there to die and to hoard their goods, and their bones and treasures fill a cavern under the sand. A giant tiger's head rises from the sand at its gate and asks what the most powerful magic is: true love's kiss, friendship, or an uninterrupted long rest. Within, the genie [[People/Jaskar|Jaskar]] kept the [[Phenomena/Enchanted Mirror|enchanted mirror]] that the demigod Maui hid there.
